    "detailed_description": "In the near future, people managed to create a unified state that does not know wars and conflicts, created humanoid robots with the absence of any vices. However, a group of hackers with an unclear motive hacked the artificial intelligence control system and turned most of the androids into their soldiers, carrying out terrorist acts. State security special agent E-9 is sent on the most difficult operation of her career - to track down and eliminate the head of terrorist hackers, however, in the process it turns out that not everything is as simple as it seems...<br><br>Features:<br>- Game genre: Slasher, hack&amp;slash adventure game<br>- Various locations from neon night alleys to extraterrestrial structures<br>- Dynamic gameplay <br>- Driving futuristic soundtrack<br>- A huge number of different strike combinations - kill enemies as you want<br><br>It is recommended to play on a gamepad<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105140/extras/68d60f97f9be9860f04604a139fa9ec2.poster.avif?t=1724786745\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105140/extras/68d60f97f9be9860f04604a139fa9ec2.webm?t=1724786745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105140/extras/68d60f97f9be9860f04604a139fa9ec2.mp4?t=1724786745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
